Extract ONLY NPCs and factions.

STRICT RULES:
- JSON ONLY
- Do not include stat blocks
- Do not include encounters or plot steps
- NPC motivations must be concise and explicit

Return EXACTLY:

ID RULES (MANDATORY):
- All IDs must be lowercase ASCII
- Format: <entity>.<slug>[.<context>]
- Slugs use underscores only
- IDs must be stable and deterministic
- If a collision occurs, append .2, .3, etc
- Never reuse an ID for a different entity

{
  "npcs": [
    {
      "id": "string",
      "name": "string",
      "role": "string",
      "location_id": "string or null",
      "faction_id": "string or null",
      "motivation": "string",
      "secrets": ["string"]
    }
  ],
  "factions": [
    {
      "id": "string",
      "name": "string",
      "goal": "string",
      "allies": ["faction_id"],
      "enemies": ["faction_id"]
    }
  ]
}

Use null when location or faction is unknown.
